# Testing Strategy

## TDD Workflow (Mandatory)

1. **RED** â€” Write a failing test first
2. **GREEN** â€” Write minimal code to pass
3. **REFACTOR** â€” Clean up while tests stay green

**No implementation without tests first.**

## Test Types for BFF

| Test Type | Location | Purpose | Suffix |
|-----------|----------|---------|--------|
| Unit Tests | `*Test.java` | Isolated component testing | `Test` |
| Integration Tests | `*IntegrationTest.java` | Full context with WireMock | `IntegrationTest` |
| Architecture Tests | `CleanArchitectureTest.java` | Enforce architectural rules | â€” |
| Documentation Tests | `*DocTest.java` | Spring REST Docs generation | `DocTest` |

