## AssertJ Assertions

```java
import static org.assertj.core.api.Assertions.*;

// Result pattern assertions
assertThat(result.isSuccess()).isTrue();
assertThat(result.isFailure()).isTrue();

var success = (Result.Success<T>) result;
assertThat(success.value()).isNotNull();

var failure = (Result.Failure<T>) result;
assertThat(failure.error().code()).isEqualTo("Backend.Unsupported");

// Collection assertions
assertThat(results)
    .hasSize(3)
    .extracting(ContainerSearchResult::containerNumber)
    .containsExactly("MSCU1234567", "TCLU9876543", "HAHY5770680");

// Exception assertions
assertThatThrownBy(() -> service.process(null))
    .isInstanceOf(IllegalArgumentException.class)
    .hasMessage("Input cannot be null");
```

